{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's an understanding between humans and the animals in the forest - &quot;Don't trust Morgathrax the evil circus director&quot;. For  reasons currently unknown, the denizens of the forest appear to have forgotten this pact.\u00a0<br><br>&quot;How bad can he really be? I try to stay away from politics&quot; - Bear<br><br>Now it is up to the people of the village to defeat the corruption spreading through the woods. Rally a band of townsfolk, wander into the forest and face Morgathrax to put things right again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh yeah, it'll be difficult... if you fail, there's only one thing left to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally a band of townsfolk, wander into the forest and face Morgathrax to put things right again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you fail... you get it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you'll find in the forest</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based tactical gameplay</strong>\u00a0<br>Units can do two things, in order - move, and attack. Tactical positioning is key to success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/5866086b0655fcf6b209892f0caf902f.apng?t=1771829143\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/5866086b0655fcf6b209892f0caf902f.poster.avif?t=1771829143\" class=\"bb_img\" width=625 height=410 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Telegraphed enemy attacks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll know exactly what (most) enemies will do on their turn. Hope this helps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/427ab4aea7a514408e55e18d22950778.apng?t=1771829143\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/427ab4aea7a514408e55e18d22950778.poster.avif?t=1771829143\" class=\"bb_img\" width=645 height=420 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit and upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, you'll be able to spend coins on upgrades and new recruits.\u00a0<br><br>Will you invest heavily in a crack squad of a few units, try for a balanced approach or grow your team to a size worthy of its own HR department? <br><br>Another Cannon unit, or First Strike for your Halberd?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/bc855aece0e0297f11194ad4471f28b9.poster.avif?t=1771829143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/bc855aece0e0297f11194ad4471f28b9.webm?t=1771829143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied squad composition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run allows you to try new combinations of units and skills from a large pool of possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 recruitable units and over 130 different upgrade types means there's more than one way to cut a tree (some of them involve shooting catapults).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/719c2bb15348d31f4b392497e154b48c.avif?t=1771829143\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/8f06af3ca1b1801fcc4daa99223e3bf3.apng?t=1771829143\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/8f06af3ca1b1801fcc4daa99223e3bf3.poster.avif?t=1771829143\" class=\"bb_img\" width=525 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even before the corruption started, the forest had a lot of mysteries within:<br>- Is it possible for the frog merchant to make a profit if he doesn't charge for his wares?<br>- Why are gnomes constantly racing their horses?<br>- How does one attain the favor of the fairies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one way to find out:<br><br>Rally a band of townsfolk, wander into the forest and face Morgathrax to put things right again!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/7bd412ff2da9346ed97caf83ece50c69.apng?t=1771829143\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/7bd412ff2da9346ed97caf83ece50c69.poster.avif?t=1771829143\" class=\"bb_img\" width=485 height=545 /></picture></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832200?t=1771829143","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832200?t=1771829143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/85c3d734f4adf5877bf1ad4f977ff88576634ec2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771829143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/85c3d734f4adf5877bf1ad4f977ff88576634ec2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771829143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's an understanding between humans and the animals in the forest - &quot;Don't trust Morgathrax the evil circus director&quot;. For  reasons currently unknown, the denizens of the forest appear to have forgotten this pact.\u00a0<br><br>&quot;How bad can he really be? I try to stay away from politics&quot; - Bear<br><br>Now it is up to the people of the village to defeat the corruption spreading through the woods. Rally a band of townsfolk, wander into the forest and face Morgathrax to put things right again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh yeah, it'll be difficult... if you fail, there's only one thing left to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally a band of townsfolk, wander into the forest and face Morgathrax to put things right again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you fail... you get it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you'll find in the forest</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based tactical gameplay</strong>\u00a0<br>Units can do two things, in order - move, and attack. Tactical positioning is key to success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/5866086b0655fcf6b209892f0caf902f.apng?t=1771829143\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/5866086b0655fcf6b209892f0caf902f.poster.avif?t=1771829143\" class=\"bb_img\" width=625 height=410 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Telegraphed enemy attacks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll know exactly what (most) enemies will do on their turn. Hope this helps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/427ab4aea7a514408e55e18d22950778.apng?t=1771829143\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/427ab4aea7a514408e55e18d22950778.poster.avif?t=1771829143\" class=\"bb_img\" width=645 height=420 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit and upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, you'll be able to spend coins on upgrades and new recruits.\u00a0<br><br>Will you invest heavily in a crack squad of a few units, try for a balanced approach or grow your team to a size worthy of its own HR department? <br><br>Another Cannon unit, or First Strike for your Halberd?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/bc855aece0e0297f11194ad4471f28b9.poster.avif?t=1771829143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/bc855aece0e0297f11194ad4471f28b9.webm?t=1771829143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied squad composition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run allows you to try new combinations of units and skills from a large pool of possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 recruitable units and over 130 different upgrade types means there's more than one way to cut a tree (some of them involve shooting catapults).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/719c2bb15348d31f4b392497e154b48c.avif?t=1771829143\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/8f06af3ca1b1801fcc4daa99223e3bf3.apng?t=1771829143\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/8f06af3ca1b1801fcc4daa99223e3bf3.poster.avif?t=1771829143\" class=\"bb_img\" width=525 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even before the corruption started, the forest had a lot of mysteries within:<br>- Is it possible for the frog merchant to make a profit if he doesn't charge for his wares?<br>- Why are gnomes constantly racing their horses?<br>- How does one attain the favor of the fairies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one way to find out:<br><br>Rally a band of townsfolk, wander into the forest and face Morgathrax to put things right again!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/7bd412ff2da9346ed97caf83ece50c69.apng?t=1771829143\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/extras/7bd412ff2da9346ed97caf83ece50c69.poster.avif?t=1771829143\" class=\"bb_img\" width=485 height=545 /></picture></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Jens Arvidsson"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832200/7d633efcdc6892cfbdb5b7413cdf8dd94fba92f0/header.jpg?t=1771829143","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any that can run a .NET 6.0 runtime<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Must support OpenGL 2.1 or higher.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.0+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel<br></li><l